Name: IndicConformer
Short Name: indicconformer
URL: https://huggingface.co/ai4bharat/indic-conformer-600m-multilingual
Version: 2a77d305038dfc502fd9464e7d028b90381976cb
License: MIT
License File: LICENSE
Security Critical: no
Shipped: yes

Description:
AI4Bharat's IndicConformer (600M, multilingual) turns call audio into Hindi,
Tamil and Bengali captions on the device (D4). Tark uses its CTC decoder,
vocabulary and language masks, and its preprocessor's window and mel matrix.
The model card states the MIT licence; the repository has no licence file,
so LICENSE here is the MIT text with AI4Bharat as the holder. Version is the
Hugging Face commit.

Local Modifications:
The encoder is quantized to int8 (ONNX Runtime dynamic quantization;
encoder.int8.onnx, sha256
2c6804fa6bc7c8b7326f0aefa78fd26699412032d882a898542f95a51b52dfa0). The
preprocessor's constants are exported as raw float32 files
(utils/captions_export.py).
